<figure class="mw-halign-center" typeof="mw:File"><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Picture_of_the_Year/2006" title="Image de l'année"><img alt="Image de l'année" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/PODY_candidate.svg/40px-PODY_candidate.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="40" height="30" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/PODY_candidate.svg/120px-PODY_candidate.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="148" data-file-height="111"></a><figcaption>Image de l'année</figcaption></figure><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Ancienne Image remarquable"><img alt="Ancienne Image remarquable" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Cscr-former.svg/40px-Cscr-former.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="40" height="38" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Cscr-former.svg/120px-Cscr-former.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="462" data-file-height="438"></span></span>
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td style="width:30px;text-align:center;" rowspan="2">
<p><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Wikimédia Commons"><img alt="Wikimédia Commons" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/40px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="40" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/60px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="1024" data-file-height="1376"></span></span><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Wikipédia"><img alt="Wikipédia" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/40px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="30" height="27" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/60px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="103" data-file-height="94"></span></span>
</p>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>Ce fichier a été proposé en tant que <b>candidat à</b> l’<b><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Picture_of_the_Year/2006" title="Commons:Picture of the Year/2006">image de l’année 2006</a></b>.<br>Ceci était préalablement une image remarquable sur Wikimedia Commons (<a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Images_remarquables" class="mw-redirect" title="Commons:Images remarquables">Images remarquables</a>) et était <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Featured_picture_candidates/removal/File:Clock_Tower_-_Palace_of_Westminster,_London_-_September_2006.jpg" title="Commons:Featured picture candidates/removal/File:Clock Tower - Palace of Westminster, London - September 2006.jpg">considéré(e)</a> comme l'une de nos meilleures images.<br><hr>
<table class="mw-collapsible mw-collapsed" style="clear:both;margin:2px auto;background:var(--background-color-warning-subtle,#FAF5E6);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--border-color-base, #a2a9b1);padding:1px;width:100%">

<tbody><tr>
<th scope="col" style="font-size:100%;background:var(--background-color-warning-subtle,#FAF5E6);border:none;color:inherit;padding:0 .2em;text-align:center">Wikipédia
</th></tr>
<tr>
<td class="mw-collapsible-content" style="font-size:100%;border:none;padding:0;text-align:left"><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/20px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="19" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/40px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="466" data-file-height="443"></span></span>&nbsp;Ceci est une image remarquable sur la Wikipédia en allemand (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/de:Wikipedia:Exzellente_Bilder" class="extiw" title="w:de:Wikipedia:Exzellente Bilder">Exzellente Bilder</a>) et est <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/de:Wikipedia:Kandidaten_f%C3%BCr_exzellente_Bilder/Clock_Tower_-_Palace_of_Westminster,_London_-_September_2006.jpg" class="extiw" title="w:de:Wikipedia:Kandidaten für exzellente Bilder/Clock Tower - Palace of Westminster, London - September 2006.jpg">considéré(e)</a> comme l'une de nos meilleures images.<br><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Featured_article_star_-_cross.svg/20px-Featured_article_star_-_cross.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Featured_article_star_-_cross.svg/40px-Featured_article_star_-_cross.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="180" data-file-height="180"></span></span>&nbsp;Ceci était préalablement une image remarquable sur la Wikipédia en anglais (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:WP:Featured_pictures" class="extiw" title="w:en:WP:Featured pictures">Featured pictures</a>) et était <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:WP:Featured_picture_candidates/Clock_Tower_-_Palace_of_Westminster,_London_-_September_2006.jpg" class="extiw" title="w:en:WP:Featured picture candidates/Clock Tower - Palace of Westminster, London - September 2006.jpg">considéré(e)</a> comme l'une de nos meilleures images.<br><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/20px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="19" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/40px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="466" data-file-height="443"></span></span>&nbsp;Ceci est une image remarquable sur la Wikipédia en persan (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/fa:%D9%88%DB%8C%DA%A9%DB%8C%E2%80%8C%D9%BE%D8%AF%DB%8C%D8%A7:%D9%86%DA%AF%D8%A7%D8%B1%D9%87%E2%80%8C%D9%87%D8%A7%DB%8C_%D8%A8%D8%B1%DA%AF%D8%B2%DB%8C%D8%AF%D9%87" class="extiw" title="w:fa:ویکی‌پدیا:نگاره‌های برگزیده">نگاره‌های برگزیده</a>) et est <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/fa:%D9%88%DB%8C%DA%A9%DB%8C%E2%80%8C%D9%BE%D8%AF%DB%8C%D8%A7:%DA%AF%D8%B2%DB%8C%D8%AF%D9%86_%D9%86%DA%AF%D8%A7%D8%B1%D9%87_%D8%A8%D8%B1%DA%AF%D8%B2%DB%8C%D8%AF%D9%87/Clock_Tower_-_Palace_of_Westminster,_London_-_September_2006.jpg" class="extiw" title="w:fa:ویکی‌پدیا:گزیدن نگاره برگزیده/Clock Tower - Palace of Westminster, London - September 2006.jpg">considéré(e)</a> comme l'une de nos meilleures images.<br><span typeof="mw:File"><span><img src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/20px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="19" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e7/Cscr-featured.svg/40px-Cscr-featured.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="466" data-file-height="443"></span></span>&nbsp;Ceci est une image remarquable sur la Wikipédia en turc (<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/tr:Vikipedi:Se%C3%A7kin_resimler" class="extiw" title="w:tr:Vikipedi:Seçkin resimler">Seçkin resimler</a>) et est <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/tr:Vikipedi:Se%C3%A7kin_resim_adaylar%C4%B1/Clock_Tower_-_Palace_of_Westminster,_London_-_September_2006.jpg" class="extiw" title="w:tr:Vikipedi:Seçkin resim adayları/Clock Tower - Palace of Westminster, London - September 2006.jpg">considéré(e)</a> comme l'une de nos meilleures images.<br>
