<div class="mw-heading mw-heading2"><h2 id="Description">Description</h2></div>
<div class="hproduct commons-file-information-table">
<table class="fileinfotpl-type-information vevent" dir="ltr">

<tbody><tr>
<td id="fileinfotpl_desc" class="fileinfo-paramfield" lang="fr">Description<span class="summary fn" style="display:none">Clock Tower - Palace of Westminster, London - September 2006.jpg</span></td>
<td class="description">
<div class="description en" dir="ltr" lang="en"><span class="language en" title="anglais"><b>English: </b></span> The Clock Tower of the Palace of Westminster, colloquially known as "Big Ben", in Westminster, London, England.</div>
<div class="description fr" dir="ltr" lang="fr"><span class="language fr" title="français"><b>Français&nbsp;: </b></span> Tour de l'horloge du palais de Westminster, couramment nommée "Big Ben". Londres (Angleterre).</div> 
<div class="description fa" dir="rtl" lang="fa"><span class="language fa" title="persan"><b>فارسی: </b></span> برج ساعت کاخ وستمینستر، پارلمان بریتانیا در شهر لندن، که به «بیگ بن» مشهور است.</div>
<div class="description ja" dir="ltr" lang="ja"><span class="language ja" title="japonais"><b>日本語:</b></span> 通称<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ja:%E3%83%93%E3%83%83%E3%82%B0%E3%83%BB%E3%83%99%E3%83%B3" class="extiw" title="w:ja:ビッグ・ベン">ビッグ・ベン</a>として知られる<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ja:%E8%8B%B1%E5%9B%BD" class="extiw" title="w:ja:英国">英国</a>、<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ja:%E3%83%AD%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%B3" class="extiw" title="w:ja:ロンドン">ロンドン</a>の<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ja:%E3%82%A6%E3%82%A7%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%9F%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E5%AE%AE%E6%AE%BF" class="extiw" title="w:ja:ウェストミンスター宮殿">ウェストミンスター宮殿</a>の時計塔。</div>
<div class="description ro" dir="ltr" lang="ro"><span class="language ro" title="roumain"><b>Română: </b></span> Turnul ceasului al palatului Westminister, cunoscut ca "Big Ben", Londra.</div>
<div class="description es" dir="ltr" lang="es"><span class="language es" title="espagnol"><b>Español: </b></span> Torre del Reloj del palacio de Westminster, coloquialmente conocida como "Big Ben", en Westminster, Londres, Inglaterra(Angleterre).</div> 
<div class="description syl" dir="ltr" lang="syl"><span class="language syl" title="Sylheti"><b>ꠍꠤꠟꠐꠤ: </b></span> <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/syl:%EA%A0%9F%EA%A0%98%EA%A0%86%EA%A0%92%EA%A0%98_%EA%A0%98%EA%A0%89%EA%A0%9E%EA%A0%A4" class="extiw" title="w:syl:ꠟꠘ꠆ꠒꠘ ꠘꠉꠞꠤ">ꠟꠘ꠆ꠒꠘ ꠘꠉꠞꠤꠞ</a> ꠊꠠꠤ ⁕</div></td>
</tr>

<tr>
