<tbody><tr>
<td class="potd-icon"><span typeof="mw:File"><span title="Image du jour"><img alt="Image du jour" src="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Potd-logo.svg/120px-Potd-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="64" height="64" class="mw-file-element" srcset="https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/cd/Potd-logo.svg/250px-Potd-logo.svg.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" data-file-width="124" data-file-height="124"></span></span>
</td>
<td><span id="field-potd" title="20071118"></span><div lang="fr">Cette image a été choisie comme <b><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:Image_du_jour" class="mw-redirect" title="Commons:Image du jour">image du jour</a></b> pour le <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Template:Potd/2007-11#18" title="Template:Potd/2007-11">18 novembre 2007</a>. La description associée était la suivante&nbsp;:</div><div class="description fr" dir="ltr" lang="fr"><span class="language fr" title="français"><b>Français&nbsp;: </b></span> Tour de l'horloge du palais de <a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westminster" class="extiw" title="fr:Westminster">Westminster</a>, couramment nommée <i>Big Ben</i>, d'après le nom de la cloche qui s'y trouve. <a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Londres" class="extiw" title="fr:Londres">Londres</a> (<a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angleterre" class="extiw" title="fr:Angleterre">Angleterre</a>).</div><div class="tpl-hidden mw-collapsible mw-collapsed">
<style data-mw-deduplicate="TemplateStyles:r922807911">.mw-parser-output .tpl-hidden{clear:both}.mw-parser-output .tpl-hidden>.mw-collapsible-toggle{float:none}.mw-parser-output .tpl-hidden::before{display:none}.mw-parser-output .tpl-hidden.mw-made-collapsible>.mw-collapsible-toggle>.tpl-hidden-arrowtoggle{padding-left:20px;background-image:url("https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/10/MediaWiki_Vector_skin_action_arrow.png");background-position:left 50%;background-repeat:no-repeat}.mw-parser-output .tpl-hidden.mw-made-collapsible.mw-collapsed>.mw-collapsible-toggle>.tpl-hidden-arrowtoggle{background-image:url("https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/MediaWiki_Vector_skin_right_arrow.png")}.mw-parser-output [dir=rtl] .tpl-hidden.mw-made-collapsible.mw-collapsed>.mw-collapsible-toggle>.tpl-hidden-arrowtoggle{background-image:url("https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/MediaWiki_Vector_skin_left_arrow.png")}</style>
<div class="mw-collapsible-toggle" style="font-weight:bold; ; text-align:start; float:none;font-size:smaller;"><span class="tpl-hidden-arrowtoggle skin-invert"></span><span class="tpl-hidden-headertext">Autres langues&nbsp;:</span></div>
<div class="mw-collapsible-content" style="font-weight:normal; color: inherit;; text-align:start;">
<div class="multilingual"><div class="description ast lang-ast" lang="ast" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ast" lang="ast" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Asturianu</bdi>: </span> La <b>Torre'l reló</b> o  "<b>Big Ben</b>" nel Palaciu de Westminster, en <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Londres" class="mw-redirect" title="Londres">Londres</a>, <a href="https://ast.wikipedia.org/wiki/Reinu_Xun%C3%ADu" class="extiw" title="ast:Reinu Xuníu">Reinu Xuníu</a>.</div><div class="description cs lang-cs" lang="cs" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-cs" lang="cs" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Čeština</bdi>: </span> Hodinová věž Westminsterského paláce, běžně označovaná jako <a href="https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Ben" class="extiw" title="cs:Big Ben">„Big Ben“</a>, v <a href="https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lond%C3%BDn" class="extiw" title="cs:Londýn">Londýně</a>, <a href="https://cs.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anglie" class="extiw" title="cs:Anglie">Anglie</a>.</div><div class="description da lang-da" lang="da" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-da" lang="da" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Dansk</bdi>: </span> Klokketårnet ved <a href="https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palace_of_Westminster" class="extiw" title="da:Palace of Westminster">Palace of Westminster</a> i <a href="https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/London" class="extiw" title="da:London">London</a>, <a href="https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Storbritannien" class="extiw" title="da:Storbritannien">Storbritannien</a>. Ofte kaldt <a href="https://da.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Ben" class="extiw" title="da:Big Ben">Big Ben</a> efter klokken.</div><div class="description de lang-de" lang="de" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-de" lang="de" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Deutsch</bdi>: </span> Der Uhrturm des <a href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palace_of_Westminster" class="extiw" title="de:Palace of Westminster">Westminster-Palastes</a> in London, oft auch <a href="https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Ben" class="extiw" title="de:Big Ben">Big Ben</a> genannt.</div><div class="description en lang-en" lang="en" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-en" lang="en" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>English</bdi>: </span> The Clock Tower of the Palace of Westminster, colloquially known as "Big Ben", <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/London" title="London">London</a>, <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/England" title="England">England</a>.</div><div class="description es lang-es" lang="es" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-es" lang="es" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Español</bdi>: </span> La Torre del Reloj del Palacio de Westminster, coloquialmente conocida como «Big Ben», <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/London" title="London">Londres</a>, <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/England" title="England">Inglaterra</a>.</div><div class="description fr lang-fr" lang="fr" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-fr" lang="fr" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Français</bdi> : </span> Tour de l'horloge du palais de <a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westminster" class="extiw" title="fr:Westminster">Westminster</a>, couramment nommée <i>Big Ben</i>, d'après le nom de la cloche qui s'y trouve. <a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Londres" class="extiw" title="fr:Londres">Londres</a> (<a href="https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angleterre" class="extiw" title="fr:Angleterre">Angleterre</a>).</div><div class="description is lang-is" lang="is" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-is" lang="is" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Íslenska</bdi>: </span> Klukkuturn <a href="https://is.wikipedia.org/wiki/Westminster-h%C3%B6ll" class="extiw" title="is:Westminster-höll">Westminster-hallar</a>, betur þekktur sem <a href="https://is.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Ben" class="extiw" title="is:Big Ben">Big Ben</a>, í <a href="https://is.wikipedia.org/wiki/London" class="extiw" title="is:London">London</a>.</div><div class="description it lang-it" lang="it" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-it" lang="it" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Italiano</bdi>: </span> Torre dell'orologio del <a href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palazzo_di_Westminster" class="extiw" title="it:Palazzo di Westminster">Palazzo di Westminster</a>, più noto come <i><a href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Ben" class="extiw" title="it:Big Ben">Big Ben</a></i>, <a href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Londra" class="extiw" title="it:Londra">Londra</a>, <a href="https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Regno_Unito" class="extiw" title="it:Regno Unito">Regno Unito</a>.</div><div class="description lt lang-lt" lang="lt" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-lt" lang="lt" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Lietuvių</bdi>: </span> Vestminsterio rūmų laikrodžio bokštas, žinomas, kaip „Big Ben'as“, <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/London" title="London">Londonas</a>, <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/England" title="England">Anglija</a>.</div><div class="description hu lang-hu" lang="hu" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-hu" lang="hu" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Magyar</bdi>: </span> A Westminster palota óratornya, közkeletű nevén „<a href="https://hu.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Ben" class="extiw" title="hu:Big Ben">Big Ben</a>“ (London)</div><div class="description nl lang-nl" lang="nl" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-nl" lang="nl" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Nederlands</bdi>: </span> De <a href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Ben" class="extiw" title="nl:Big Ben">Big Ben</a>, onderdeel van het <a href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Palace_of_Westminster" class="extiw" title="nl:Palace of Westminster">Palace of Westminster</a>, het parlementsgebouw van het <a href="https://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/Verenigd_Koninkrijk" class="extiw" title="nl:Verenigd Koninkrijk">Verenigd Koninkrijk</a>.</div><div class="description pl lang-pl" lang="pl" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-pl" lang="pl" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Polski</bdi>: </span> Wieża zegarowa Pałacu Westminsterskiego, potocznie zwana "Big Ben" (<a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/London" title="London">Londyn</a>, <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/England" title="England">Anglia</a>).</div><div class="description pt lang-pt" lang="pt" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-pt" lang="pt" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Português</bdi>: </span> A torre do relógio do <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/pt:Pal%C3%A1cio_de_Westminster" class="extiw" title="w:pt:Palácio de Westminster">Palácio de Westminster</a>, popularmente conhecida como "Big Ben", em <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/London" title="London">Londres</a>, no <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/England" title="England">Reino Unido</a>.</div><div class="description sv lang-sv" lang="sv" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-sv" lang="sv" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Svenska</bdi>: </span> <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Palace_of_Westminster" title="Palace of Westminster">Westminsterpalatsets</a> <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Clock_towers" title="Category:Clock towers">klocktorn</a> innehåller den kända klockan <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Big_Ben" title="Big Ben">Big Ben</a>.</div><div class="description tr lang-tr" lang="tr" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-tr" lang="tr" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Türkçe</bdi>: </span> Londra'da Westminster Sarayı'nın yanındaki <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Big_Ben" title="Big Ben">Big Ben</a> (Büyük Benjamin), dünyanın en büyük dört taraflı saatidir.</div><div class="description be lang-be" lang="be" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-be" lang="be" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Беларуская</bdi>: </span> Званніца <a href="https://be.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%92%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%BC%D1%96%D0%BD%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D1%96_%D0%BF%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%86" class="extiw" title="be:Вестмінстарскі палац">Вестмінстарскага палацу</a> — «Біг Бен», <a href="https://be.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%9B%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B4%D0%B0%D0%BD" class="extiw" title="be:Лондан">Лондан</a>, <a href="https://be.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%90%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%BB%D1%96%D1%8F" class="extiw" title="be:Англія">Англія</a>.</div><div class="description ru lang-ru" lang="ru" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ru" lang="ru" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Русский</bdi>: </span> Часовая башня Вестминстерского дворца, более известная как Биг Бен (Лондон)</div><div class="description sr lang-sr" lang="sr" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-sr" lang="sr" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>Српски / srpski</bdi>: </span> „Биг Бен“ (<i><a href="https://sr.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%95%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%BB%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8_%D1%98%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B8%D0%BA" class="extiw" title="sr:Енглески језик">енгл.</a> Big Ben</i>), сат-торањ <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Palace_of_Westminster" title="Category:Palace of Westminster">вестминистерске палате</a> у <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/London" title="London">Лондону</a>, <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/England" title="England">Енглеска</a>.</div><div class="description ka lang-ka" lang="ka" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ka" lang="ka" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>ქართული</bdi>: </span> უესტმინსტერის სასახლის საათის კოშკი "ბიგ ბენი", <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/London" title="London">ლონდონი</a>, <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/England" title="England">ინგლისი</a>.</div><div class="description ja lang-ja" lang="ja" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ja" lang="ja" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>日本語</bdi>：</span> 通称<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ja:%E3%83%93%E3%83%83%E3%82%B0%E3%83%BB%E3%83%99%E3%83%B3" class="extiw" title="w:ja:ビッグ・ベン">ビッグ・ベン</a>として知られる<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ja:%E8%8B%B1%E5%9B%BD" class="extiw" title="w:ja:英国">英国</a>、<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ja:%E3%83%AD%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%B3" class="extiw" title="w:ja:ロンドン">ロンドン</a>の<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ja:%E3%82%A6%E3%82%A7%E3%82%B9%E3%83%88%E3%83%9F%E3%83%B3%E3%82%B9%E3%82%BF%E3%83%BC%E5%AE%AE%E6%AE%BF" class="extiw" title="w:ja:ウェストミンスター宮殿">ウェストミンスター宮殿</a>の時計塔。</div><div class="description zh lang-zh" lang="zh" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-zh" lang="zh" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>中文</bdi>：</span> <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/UK" class="mw-redirect" title="UK">英国</a><a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/London" title="London">伦敦</a>西敏寺的“大本钟”。</div><div class="description zh-hant lang-zh-hant" lang="zh-hant" dir="ltr" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-zh-hant" lang="zh-hant" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>中文（繁體）</bdi>：</span> <a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8B%B1%E5%9C%8B" class="extiw" title="zh:英國">英國</a><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%80%AB%E6%95%A6" class="extiw" title="zh:倫敦">倫敦</a><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E6%95%8F%E5%B8%82" class="extiw" title="zh:西敏市">西敏市</a>的<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E6%95%8F%E5%AE%AE" class="extiw" title="zh:西敏宮">西敏宮</a><a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%90%98%E6%A8%93" class="extiw" title="zh:鐘樓">鐘樓</a>，俗稱為<a href="https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A7%E7%AC%A8%E9%90%98" class="extiw" title="zh:大笨鐘">大笨鐘</a></div><div class="description ar lang-ar" lang="ar" dir="rtl" style="margin:.25em 0;line-height:normal;"><span class="language langlabel-ar" lang="ar" style="font-weight:bold;"><bdi>العربية</bdi>&nbsp;: </span> ساعة قصر وستمنستر،‌ المعروفة باسم "بيج بن" في <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/London" title="London">لندن</a>، <a href="//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/England" title="England">المملكة المتحدة</a></div></div>
</div></div>
</td></tr></tbody></table><h1 class="mw-slot-header"><mediainfoslotheader></mediainfoslotheader></h1><mediainfoview style="display: none"><mediainfoviewcaptions><div class="wbmi-entityview-captionsPanel oo-ui-layout oo-ui-panelLayout oo-ui-panelLayout-framed"><h3 class="wbmi-entityview-captions-header">Légendes</h3><div class="wbmi-entityview-caption oo-ui-layout oo-ui-horizontalLayout"><label class="wbmi-language-label oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-labelElement-label oo-ui-labelElement oo-ui-labelWidget">français</label><div lang="fr" dir="ltr" class="wbmi-caption-value">Great Britain</div></div><div style="display:none;" class="wbmi-entityview-caption wbmi-entityview-hideable oo-ui-layout oo-ui-horizontalLayout"><label class="wbmi-language-label oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-labelElement-label oo-ui-labelElement oo-ui-labelWidget">anglais</label><div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="wbmi-caption-value">صورة ساعة بيج بن</div></div><div style="display:none;" class="wbmi-entityview-caption wbmi-entityview-hideable oo-ui-layout oo-ui-horizontalLayout"><label class="wbmi-language-label oo-ui-widget oo-ui-widget-enabled oo-ui-labelElement-label oo-ui-labelElement oo-ui-labelWidget">Sylheti</label><div lang="syl" dir="ltr" class="wbmi-caption-value">ꠟꠘ꠆ꠒꠘ ꠊꠠꠤ</div></div></div></mediainfoviewcaptions><mediainfoviewstatements><div id="P180" data-mw-property="P180" data-mw-statements="[]" data-mw-formatvalue="[]" class="wbmi-entityview-statementsGroup wbmi-entityview-statementsGroup-P180 oo-ui-layout oo-ui-panelLayout oo-ui-panelLayout-framed"><div class="wbmi-statements-widget"><div class="wbmi-statement-header"><div class="wbmi-entity-data"><div class="wbmi-entity-title"><h3 class="wbmi-statements-title">Éléments décrits dans ce fichier</h3><h4 class="wbmi-entity-label"><bdi><a target="_blank" title="d:Special:EntityPage/P180" href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Special:EntityPage/P180">dépeint</a></bdi></h4></div></div></div><div class="wbmi-content-items-g